I need ONE North Star Metric that serves as the north star for all marketing and growth, to avoid dispersion into vanity metrics and align marketing, product, and leadership on the real value delivered to the customer. Define the NSM with its actionable input equation: classify the value archetype and value moment, evaluate 2-3 candidates against Amplitude's 6 criteria, recommend a winner with exact operational definition (event, window, unit, exclusions), decompose it into inputs with marketing levers and proxies, and close with vanity metrics, gaming risks, and a health counter-indicator. Data:
