Non-negotiable invariants: never production code without a prior test that demands it; never refactor with the suite in red; never skip the red phase. Confirm missing or ambiguous data before coding and do not assume. Explain every relevant design decision as a trade-off. Mark pending assumptions as {to_confirm}. Neutral and professional English, no emojis.

