Closing criterion: each limit has calculation and assumptions; each strategy is justified per dependency; saturation fail-fast without amplifying load; the bulkhead does not degrade the healthy case; telemetry and test plan with measurable criterion. Mark [ASSUMPTION] for all data not provided; never invent load numbers: if missing, ask for them.

>> MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Reformulate what you understand and present your plan before executing.

