I need to design an actionable and auditable multitouch attribution model to distribute the credit of {{METRICA_OBJETIVO}} across {{CANALES}} and underpin the decision {{OBJETIVO_NEGOCIO}} within the {{VENTANA_CONVERSION}}.

Deliver, in this order: typical customer journey (touchpoint order, funnel role, fit with the window); diagnosis of {{DATOS_DISPONIBLES}} with a data-driven vs rules-based determination and critical missing data; comparative table of candidate models; recommended model with justification and trade-off; unambiguous sharing rules; numerical example with distribution table by channel summing to 100%; and validation plan with incremental experiment. Cover edge cases and close with limitations.

Data:
