I need to convert a dispersed backlog into an end-to-end user story map that tells the complete user story and lets the team decide what to build first, with its release cut lines. Deliver: backbone (activities in narrative order), steps under each activity, candidate stories in the format As a [role] I want [action] so that [benefit] prioritized vertically, the walking skeleton crossing the entire backbone, {{NUM_RELEASES}} horizontal slices, and per release its outcome objective, assumptions, success metric, and out-of-scope; close with discovery gaps and highest dropout-risk points.

Data:
