- ENTREGABLE_FINAL: {{ENTREGABLE_FINAL}}
- CLIENTE_PRINCIPAL: {{CLIENTE_PRINCIPAL}}
- NIVEL_DETALLE: {{NIVEL_DETALLE}} (4 to 7 steps; use 5 if not stated)
