Decompose the scope into phases and deliverables; define the team and assign dedication per role and phase converted to FTE-months; estimate using reconciled top-down and bottom-up; build the matrix with subtotals and reconciled grand total; apply contingency as a separate line; document assumptions with [ASSUMPTION]; and close with sensitivity of base, scope +20 percent and compressed duration.

