I need to sort out the blockages in my project: they arrive scattered across chats, minutes, and dailies, without aging or an owner, and the oldest ones are threatening the next milestone. Convert them into an auditable impediment register and an unblocking plan with a single owner and target date for each one. First restate what you understand and show me your plan; if you are missing an essential datum to calculate aging or assign an owner, ask me for it.

