Closing criterion: the phase is justified signal by signal; each intervention has what to do, owner, success signal, and timeline; the recommended leadership style is contrasted with the current one naming the gap; the progress signals are observable and tied to the critical objective and horizon; each regression risk carries mitigation. Deliverable: brief prose diagnosis + plan in a table + block of signals and risks. Neutral professional language, no emojis.

