Closing criterion: you deliver a MEDDPICC table of eight rows plus a synthesis block (score with weighting, single advance/nurture/disqualify verdict consistent with the reds, three risks with early warning signal, next steps with owner and date) ready to paste into the CRM. Neutral, professional Spanish, no prices, no emojis.

