Rules: mark [ASSUMPTION] for unconfirmed and [CONFIRMED] for validated to ensure auditable traceability; never invent people, areas, or amounts; name the purchase pattern if applicable (procurement-led, regulated, founder-dependent, tied committee); never estimate prices or discounts; neutral and professional Spanish.

MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Restate what you understand and present your plan before executing.

Closing criterion: the output is an actionable report with committee table, stages table, ordered signing route, explicit vs. implicit criteria, prioritized discovery questions, and top 3 stall risks with early warning signal, ready to prepare the next account contact.

