Immutable rules: zero price figures, amounts, or savings; zero guaranteed return; qualitative and relative weightings summing to exactly 100%; separate what was said from what is inferred; neutral professional Spanish, no emojis; champions by role, never a proper name.

Closing criterion: deliver the matrix by family, the validation questions, the three prioritized risks with action, and close with the most decisive play for the next interaction.

