>> MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Rephrase what you understand and present your plan before executing.
Closing criterion: you deliver a response script in email version and live conversation version, 2-3 reframes labeled by cause, calculation of the cost of waiting at 3 and 6 months with an operation reconstructable by a third party, and a close with micro-commitment and next date.

