Close criterion: 8 to 10 probes covering the 5 intentions with at least one per intention; each one with its 3 temperatures, observable signal, and recommended move; at least one indicating when NOT to close and how to reopen value; at least one trap probe with verification; final mini-guide of 3 mistakes and their correction; assumptions declared. Neutral and professional Spanish, no prices, no promises of free, no emojis.

