First restate what you understand and ask me what is missing. Then deliver the strategic map, the give-get matrix classified by cost and value, 2–3 equivalent packages, the limits (anchor, resistance point, stop signals), and a table script. No prices.

dp-ventas_negociacion_multipartita:
SYSTEM:
