Deliver: 1) text flowchart (warehouse, source models, synchronization layer, destinations, with data direction); 2) data contract table per activation use case; 3) source-to-destination field mapping table with types and transformations; 4) brief operations runbook (alerts, failure, idempotent reprocessing); 5) wave-based implementation plan with promotion criteria. Cover edge cases: null keys or identity collisions, deletions in the source, schema changes, reprocessing window, and destination API quota.

