I want to use OKRs to focus my team, but I suspect the current set carries anti-patterns (disguised tasks as objectives, activity KRs, sandbagging, health KPIs smuggled in as advance metrics). Diagnose it and rewrite it: inventory and number each Objective and KR, apply the five tests, classify each finding with label and severity, rewrite the healthy set (2 to 4 measurable KRs per Objective with baseline and target, 70 percent = success, committed vs aspirational separated), and close with 3 anti-relapse rules. Give me the findings table, rewritten set, and the 3 rules.

