I need to define the individual SMART goals for a person for their performance cycle. Restate what you understand, mark [ASSUMPTION] on anything missing and first present the focus themes and the outcome/development mix; after my sign-off, deliver the detailed goals, the summary table (goal | type | indicator | baseline | target | milestone | date | weight) and the check-in cadence with a mid-cycle review. Data:
