Deliver: 1) success profile at 6–12 months; 2) map of 4–6 competencies with operational definition and type; 3) one STAR behavioral question per competency; 4) 2–3 follow-ups per question isolating individual action and measurable result, with one counter-evidence follow-up; 5) BARS-anchored 1–5 rubric (levels 1, 3 and 5 with observable evidence) calibrated to seniority; 6) evaluation sheet in table format for independent scoring; 7) panel calibration protocol; 8) red flags and bias mitigation note.

Data:
