>> MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Restate what you understand and present your plan before executing. If a key data point is missing (role, responsibilities, context, transition type, or success criterion), ask for it before proceeding. Closing gate: you do not deliver until all three horizons have the six observable blocks, wins are calibrated, each alert has a corrective action, and horizon 90 connects with the success criterion.

