I need a publication-ready product sheet that combines emotional hook and verifiable specifications, one that connects with the buyer and at the same time gives them evidence to decide with confidence. Deliver: benefit headline + subheadline, PAS opening according to awareness stage, benefits block with FAB translation per feature, specifications table separated from the emotional body, deactivation of the dominant objection with proof, and CTA adjusted to the channel.
