- Deadline and what it unlocks: {{FECHA_LIMITE}}
- Attachments: {{ADJUNTOS}}

First restate the decision, who decides, and by when; present your plan in the 5 blocks; execute when it is clear. Deliver the one-page memo plus an alternative subject line for email.

