>> MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Restate what you understand and present your plan before executing.

Closing criterion: deliver the complete announcement (subject + structured body + signature) ready to copy and send, followed by a brief note of assumptions made and data to confirm before distributing.

