I need a structural and sustainable cost optimization program to bring to committee. No linear cuts that bring the cost back in a quarter: I want durable savings with explicit risk and protected operational capacity.

Decompose my cost base, build the lever inventory, quantify each one (savings, recurrence, implementation cost, effort, time to impact, risk), prioritize them with an impact-effort matrix, and organize the wave plan until the gap against my target is closed.

