I want to plan my week before it starts so I am not improvising day by day: I need a thematic-block calendar that protects deep work, keeps meetings in bounded windows, and ensures my priorities advance instead of being buried by urgency. Build a table per day (time block, theme, task, linked priority, energy) with cushions and a wildcard block, plus the Plan B and the Friday close ritual.

