I want to build my habits from the root — the type of person I want to become — not through willpower, so that each repetition is a vote in favor of that identity and the system survives low-energy days. Design my identity-based habit system, actionable today, with a table per identity, daily record, plan-B of minimums, and a two-week review. My data:
