I need to decide which platform to use to automate a process among n8n, Make, and Zapier, with a defensible criterion. Deliver in this order: (1) restate the case in one verifiable sentence; (2) explain the real axis of the three platforms for this case (control/effort/consumption, no prices); (3) define 5 to 7 criteria with direction and weights summing to 100%, justified; (4) apply the eliminatory criteria from the constraints before scoring and name discards; (5) score each survivor 1 to 5 with a note, marking [ASSUMPTION] on what is not backed; (6) calculate the weighted score in a table ordered from highest to lowest; (7) give a committed recommendation with margin, sensitivity threshold, and 2-3 trade-offs; (8) close with a pilot validating the riskiest assumption, early warning signs, and exit plan.

